+# Data Model: Build reminder
+
+## Action input
+
+| Field | Type | Rule |
+|-------|------|------|
+| `confirmed` | boolean-like | Only literal `True` enables reminder construction. |
+| `id` | string | Non-empty when confirmed. |
+| `owner` | string | Non-empty when confirmed. |
+| `due_at` | string | ISO-8601 UTC timestamp when confirmed. |
+
+## Reminder output
+
+| Field | Type | Rule |
+|-------|------|------|
+| `id` | string | `reminder:{action id}:{due_at}` using normalized emitted `due_at`. |
+| `action_id` | string | Source action id. |
+| `owner` | string | Source action owner. |
+| `due_at` | string | Normalized UTC timestamp with `Z`. |
+| `remind_at` | string | Normalized UTC timestamp with `Z`, earlier than `due_at`. |
+
+No storage, relationships, or state transitions exist; both entities are transient mappings.
